{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hodge-star-basis-wedge","title":"prop:hodge-star-basis-wedge","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":4305,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#prop:hodge-star-basis-wedge","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hodge-star-pointwise]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hodge-star-graded]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:wedge-covectors-sign]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:wedge-covectors-repeat-zero]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:wedge-covectors]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:inner-k-covectors]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"prop:hodge-star-basis-wedge","line":7259,"source":"\\begin{proposition}[The Hodge Star of an Ordered Basis Wedge]\n\\label{prop:hodge-star-basis-wedge}\n\n\\uses{prop:hodge-star-pointwise, prop:hodge-star-graded, lem:wedge-covectors-sign, lem:wedge-covectors-repeat-zero, def:wedge-covectors, def:inner-k-covectors}\n\n\n\n\nFor a permutation $\\sigma$ and $k+l=n$, $*(e^{\\sigma(0)}\\wedge\\cdots\\wedge e^{\\sigma(k-1)})=(\\operatorname{sgn}\\sigma)e^{\\sigma(k)}\\wedge\\cdots\\wedge e^{\\sigma(n-1)}$.\n\\end{proposition}\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{prop:hodge-star-pointwise,lem:wedge-covectors-sign,lem:wedge-covectors-repeat-zero,def:wedge-covectors,def:inner-k-covectors}\n\\sketch Verify on coframe wedges; repeated indices make both sides vanish.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proposition</div></section>[The Hodge Star of an Ordered Basis Wedge] <span class=\"tex-label\"