ueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Awedge-covectors-sign\">↗ lem:wedge-covectors-sign</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Awedge-covectors-repeat-zero\">↗ lem:wedge-covectors-repeat-zero</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Awedge-covectors\">↗ def:wedge-covectors</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainner-k-covectors\">↗ def:inner-k-covectors</a> \\sketch Verify on coframe wedges; repeated indices make both sides vanish. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:hodge-star-congr-smul","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hodge-star-two-involution","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hodge-star-pointwise","title":"prop:hodge-star-pointwise","label":"prop:hodge-star-pointwise"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hodge-star-graded","title":"prop:hodge-star-graded","label":"prop:hodge-star-graded"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:wedge-covectors-sign","title":"lem:wedge-covectors-sign","label":"lem:wedge-covectors-sign"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:wedge-covectors-repeat-zero","title":"lem:wedge-covectors-repeat-zero","label":"lem:wedge-covectors-repeat-zero"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:wedge-covectors","title":"def:wedge-covectors","label":"def:wedge-covectors"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapte